WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.972
Kip had someone to play with.

2
00:00:11.973 --> 00:00:15.488
But she didn't talk.

3
00:00:15.489 --> 00:00:19.201
"She's just shy," thought Kip.

4
00:00:19.202 --> 00:00:22.957
"Let's play hide-and-seek," said Kip.

5
00:00:22.958 --> 00:00:29.798
"I'll hide first!"

6
00:00:29.799 --> 00:00:54.659
Kip ran and hid behind a bench.

7
00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:57.374
But the person didn't find him.

8
00:00:57.375 --> 00:01:03.398
She didn't even look for him.

9
00:01:03.399 --> 00:01:08.472
"Let's play catch instead!" said Kip.

10
00:01:08.473 --> 00:01:12.044
Kip threw an acorn to the person.

11
00:01:12.045 --> 00:01:14.832
But the acorn bounced off her head.

12
00:01:14.833 --> 00:01:27.078
She didn't even try to catch it.

13
00:01:27.079 --> 00:01:31.064
Bird flew over.

14
00:01:31.065 --> 00:01:34.082
"What are you doing?" she asked.

15
00:01:34.083 --> 00:01:38.129
"I'm playing with my new friend," said Kip.

16
00:01:38.130 --> 00:01:40.570
"She's a small person."

17
00:01:40.571 --> 00:01:45.894
"Hi," said Bird. "What's your name?"

18
00:01:45.895 --> 00:01:50.134
"She doesn't talk," said Kip.

19
00:01:50.135 --> 00:01:59.863
Bird looked at the person closely.

20
00:01:59.864 --> 00:02:02.966
"What does she do?" asked Bird.

21
00:02:02.967 --> 00:02:07.657
"Uh, well, nothing really," said Kip.

22
00:02:07.658 --> 00:02:11.407
"You know why?" said Bird.

23
00:02:11.408 --> 00:02:15.156
"This isn't a real person.

24
00:02:15.157 --> 00:02:20.189
This is a fake person!"

